{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 64, :comments ["And she fell from upon the camel — for modesty, because she was riding like a man, on account of the camel's swaying, as is explained in Pesaḥim."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {0 "Rashbam references b. Pesaḥim 86a, which explains that Rivqah rode sidesaddle 'like a man' (כבני אדם) due to the camel's rolling gait (ביעותא דגמלא); rendered here in Aramaic as he writes it."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:45:04.813545807Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}